+
+## Passkeys
+
+Sign-in, sign-up, and the account page (`/account`) support passkeys via [SimpleWebAuthn](https://simplewebauthn.dev/). Passwords are still verified by the external Times API (proxied through `/api/auth/login` and `/api/auth/register`); passkeys are stored by this app in `.data/passkeys.json`.
+
+| Variable | Purpose |
+| --- | --- |
+| `PASSKEY_DATA_DIR` | Directory for the passkey store (default `.data`). Point it at persistent storage in production. |
+| `WEBAUTHN_RP_ID` | Relying party ID (default: request hostname). |
+| `WEBAUTHN_ORIGIN` | Expected origin (default: request origin). Set this when running behind a proxy that rewrites the host. |
